.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-sfx-hydrate 1  "xil-sfx-hydrate " 
.SH NAME
xil\-sfx\-hydrate \- Write pipe\-hint source and attribute fields (play_volume_pct, play_duration_pct) from parsed JSON into the SFX config without re\-parsing the script.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-sfx\-hydrate\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-parsed\fR] [\fB\-\-sfx\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write pipe\-hint source and attribute fields (play_volume_pct, play_duration_pct) from parsed JSON into the SFX config without re\-parsing the script.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S04E04)
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw non\-episodic tag (e.g. V01C03)
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-parsed\fR \fI<PARSED>\fR
Override parsed JSON path
.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\fR \fI<SFX>\fR
Override SFX config path
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace a cue\*(Aqs existing \*(Aqsource\*(Aq when the script hint differs, instead of only filling in missing ones — the only way to correct a \*(AqNEW STEM NEEDED\*(Aq placeholder or a stale path. A replacement is skipped (with a warning) if the hinted file is not on disk. Replacements are written to the edit journal, so they survive a later rebuild from a fresh script. Preview with \-\-dry\-run first
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Report changes without writing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
